# Ignore everything…
*
# …except directories (otherwise Git won't look inside them)
!*/
# …and the files to keep
!*.tf
!*.tfvars
!*.txt
!README*
!.gitignore
# Explicitly ignore provider lock files
.terraform.lock.hcl
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
.terraform.tfstate.lock.info
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
*_override.tf
